DESCRIPTION:Hi tutors\,<br>by now you have heard about the awesome new enha
 nced ACT Guidewell book\, and hopefully checked it out in the curriculum li
 brary!  <br>We wanted to offer some optional space for tutors to come and a
 sk questions and talk to the Curriculum Team about the book - how to use it
 \, structure and goals\, etc.  <br>Please feel free to drop in on Friday Au
 gust 15th from 12pm-1:30pm Eastern (9am-10:30am Pacific) to chat with the t
 eam!  We will be offering a few more of these opportunities through the nex
 t few months as well\, so keep an eye out for those invites.<br><br>Here is
  the zoom link for the meeting:<p><a href="https://us02web.zoom.us/j/993697
 1624" target="_blank">https://us02web.zoom.us/j/9936971624</a></p>
