 nd your UMD UID# if you have one.  <br>2. If this is about Science in the E
 vening please look over the SIE website before we talk. <a href="http://SIE
 .umd.edu" target="_blank">SIE.umd.edu</a>.   <br> 3. If you are new to SIE 
