 in specific courses. <br>4. All appointments are Eastern time and via phone
 .  <span> Dr Presson will call you at the appointment time.  </span><i><u>P
 lease do not have this appointment while you are driving. That makes commun
 ication very difficult and is not safe. <br></u></i>
