UID:RFUF7WwRAfE2Sh0v7eRm
SUMMARY:Austin’s Off to the British Isles | Partiful
DTSTAMP:20260823T201142Z
DTSTART:20260905T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:RSVP at https://partiful.com/e/RFUF7WwRAfE2Sh0v7eRm\n\nI’m off 
	to the UK\, and before I go\, I’m throwing a massive Labor Day weekend hou
	se party to send myself off in style. Come as your favorite flavor of UK: 
	football hooligan\, Scottish Highlander\, a leprechaun\, a posh aristocrat
	 straight out of a period drama\, punk rocker\, royal family member\, or a
	nything else UK-inspired you can dream up. The theme is loose\, the vibes 
	are not.\n\nExpect a proper spread of British bites\, a playlist spanning 
	everything from Britpop to bagpipes to grime\, and plenty of chances to to
	ast me before I cross the pond. It’s less “formal tea party” and more “60 
	of my closest mates crammed into a house\, half dressed like Downton Abbey
	 and half dressed like they’re heading to a football match.”\n\nCome raise
	 a glass\, help me say my goodbyes\, and send me off properly.\n\nCostume 
	inspo: tweed and monocles\, tartan and kilts\, flat caps and football kits
	\, corsets and top hats\, punk safety pins\, or just a Union Jack draped o
	ver whatever you were already wearing.\n\nOpen invite! Bring +1’s just hav
	e them RSVP!
URL:https://partiful.com/e/RFUF7WwRAfE2Sh0v7eRm
LOCATION:Location available once RSVP'd
STATUS:CONFIRMED
DURATION:PT2H
END:VEVENT

