	THC7nhSPIQD\n\nHappy Holidays!\n\nTo celebrate the start of December\, the
	 arrival of the chillier temps\, and all the DMV friends we've made since 
	moving here in September\, the Banner Boys cordially request your company 
	at Apt 549 of Banner Lane. We'll have holiday games\, egg nog\, Christmas 
	cookies\, and an assortment of other drinks and snacks. \n\nThe theme is *
	loosely* "Christmas Film": dress up as someone from your favorite Christma
	s film\, be it "Elf\," "Home Alone\," or "It's a Wonderful Life." It's alm
	ost the season to start re-watching the old classics\, so slip on that ugl
	y Christmas sweater and come make us guess your favorite Christmas charact
	er.\n\nAlcoholic contributions are always welcome but are certainly not ex
	pected.\n\nThe Banner Boys\,\n- Ben "Meatloaf\, smeatloaf\, double beatloa
	f. I hate meatloaf” Brim\n- Christopher "It's cozier isn't it? Boy\, girl\
	, boy\, girl" Moppel\n- Tate "Cotton-headed ninnymuggins” McLean
